- **The reformat commit would have hidden the real owners.** Without the ignore file, "Fiona Formatter" would show as the third-largest owner with 293 lines. Troy would drop to 651 lines and Douglas to 470. With the ignore file, only 2 lines stay credited to the formatter.
- **Troy's and Douglas's share is probably understated.** Blame can't see through every rewrite, so some lines they originally wrote are credited to whoever last edited them.
- **Some of the ~2,000 lines aren't code.** They include the README, CI YAML, `package.json` and the LICENSE, which I didn't separate out. If you want JavaScript only, I can rerun it on the 7 `.js` files.
